{"id": "21-1025-2-4", "zh": "308.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1026-2-9", "zh": "uttaṃsa、sekhara、āveḷa、vaṭaṃsaka，指戴在头顶上的花环；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1027-2-11", "zh": "seyyā、sayana、sena 指卧具；pallaṅka、mañcaka 指床。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1028-2-4", "zh": "309.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1029-2-8", "zh": "paṭipāda 指承托床的支座；aṭanī（阴性）指床的构件，即床框，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1030-2-4", "zh": "310.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1031-2-8", "zh": "蟹脚床（kuḷīrapāda）、插脚床（āhaccapāda）、masāraka，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1032-2-8", "zh": "再加上 bundikābaddha，这四种是不同种类的床。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1033-2-4", "zh": "311.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1034-2-10", "zh": "bibbohana、upadhāna 指枕头；pīṭhikā、pīṭha、āsana 指座椅；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1035-2-10", "zh": "koccha 指贤座（bhaddapīṭha）；āsandī 被认为是另一种座椅。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1036-2-4", "zh": "312.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1037-2-6", "zh": "大型的、长毛的毛毯，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1038-2-5", "zh": "被称为 gonaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1039-2-7", "zh": "用羊毛织成、织有花纹的垫褥，叫做 cittaka。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1040-2-4", "zh": "313.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1041-2-9", "zh": "织满密集花纹的叫做 paṭalikā，白色的叫做 paṭikā；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1042-2-9", "zh": "两端起毛的叫做 uddalomī，一端起毛的叫做 ekantalomī。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "21-1043-2-4", "zh": "314.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1044-2-7", "zh": "同样是这种毛毯，大到足够十六个女子在上面跳舞的，叫做 kuttaka；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1045-2-7", "zh": "织有狮子、老虎等图案的，叫做 vikatikā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1046-2-4", "zh": "315.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1047-2-9", "zh": "kaṭṭissa 和 koseyya 依次是缀有宝石的垫褥：", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1048-2-6", "zh": "前者用丝和 kaṭṭissa 织成，后者用丝线织成。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-1049-2-4", "zh": "316.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1050-2-9", "zh": "dīpa、padīpa、pajjota 指灯；ādāsa、dappaṇa（阳性）指镜子；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1051-2-9", "zh": "geṇḍuka、kaṇḍuka 指球；tālavaṇṭa、bījanī（阴性）指扇子。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1052-2-4", "zh": "317.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1053-2-9", "zh": "caṅkoṭaka、karaṇḍa、samugga、sampuṭa 指匣子；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1054-2-8", "zh": "gāmadhamma、asaddhamma、byavāya、methuna、rati 指性交。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1055-2-4", "zh": "318.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1056-2-9", "zh": "vivāha、upayama、pāṇiggaha、pariṇaya 指婚姻；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1057-2-11", "zh": "法、欲、利合称三事（tivagga），再加上解脱就是四事（catuvagga）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1058-2-4", "zh": "319.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1059-2-10", "zh": "khujja、gaṇḍula 指驼背的人；rassa、vāmana、lakuṇḍaka 指矮子；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1060-2-8", "zh": "paṅgula、pīṭhasappī 指靠凳子挪动的跛子；paṅgu 指不能行走的人。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1061-2-4", "zh": "320.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1062-2-7", "zh": "pakkha、khañja、khoṇḍa 指瘸腿的人，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1063-2-5", "zh": "不能说话的人叫做 mūga；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1064-2-10", "zh": "手等肢体弯曲的人叫做 kuṇī；valira、kekara 指斜视的人。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1065-2-4", "zh": "321.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1066-2-4", "zh": "头上没有头发的人叫做 khallāṭa，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1067-2-6", "zh": "muṇḍa、bhaṇḍu、muṇḍika 指剃了头的人；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1068-2-5", "zh": "一只眼睛瞎了的人叫做 kāṇa，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1069-2-6", "zh": "两只眼睛都瞎了的人叫做 andha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1070-2-4", "zh": "322.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1071-2-10", "zh": "失去听力的人叫做 badhira；gilāna、byādhita、ātura 指病人；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1072-2-7", "zh": "发疯的人叫做 ummatta；khujja 等词的词性随所指的对象而定。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1073-2-4", "zh": "323.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1074-2-10", "zh": "ātaṅka、āmaya、byādhi、gada、roga、rujā，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1075-2-4", "zh": "以及 gelañña、akalla、ābādha，都指疾病；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1076-2-7", "zh": "sosa、khaya 指消瘦病。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1077-2-4", "zh": "324.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1078-2-9", "zh": "pīnasa（另有读本作 pīnāsa）指鼻病，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1079-2-5", "zh": "从鼻子流出的液体叫做 siṅghānikā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1080-2-13", "zh": "要知道 aru、vaṇa（非阴性）指伤口；phoṭa、piḷakā 指疱疹。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1081-2-4", "zh": "325.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1082-2-10", "zh": "pubba、pūya 指脓；rattātisāra、pakkhandikā 指赤痢；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1083-2-7", "zh": "apamāra、apasmāra 指癫痫；pādaphoṭa、vipādikā 指脚上皲裂起疱。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1084-2-4", "zh": "326.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1085-2-8", "zh": "vuḍḍhiroga、vātaṇḍa 指阴囊肿大；sīpada、bhārapādatā 指象皮腿；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1086-2-9", "zh": "kaṇḍū、kaṇḍūti、kaṇḍūyā、khajju、kaṇḍūvana 指瘙痒。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1087-2-4", "zh": "327.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1088-2-11", "zh": "pāma、vitacchikā、kacchu 指疥疮；sotha、sayathu 指肿胀；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1089-2-9", "zh": "dunnāmaka、arisa 指痔疮；chaddikā、vamathu 指呕吐。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1090-2-4", "zh": "328.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1091-2-8", "zh": "davathu、paritāpa 指身体灼热；tilaka、tilakāḷaka 指黑痣；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1092-2-16", "zh": "visūcikā 是指严重腹泻的霍乱；bhagandala（另一读本作 bhagandara）指肛瘘。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-1093-2-4", "zh": "329.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1094-2-10", "zh": "meha（尿病）、jara（热病）、kāsa（咳嗽）、sāsa（气喘）、kuṭṭha（麻风）、sūla（绞痛）是各种不同的疾病；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-1095-2-9", "zh": "vejja、bhisakka、rogahārī、tikicchaka 指医生。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1096-2-4", "zh": "330.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1097-2-8", "zh": "sallavejja、sallakatta 指外科医生；tikicchā、patikriyā 指治疗；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1098-2-11", "zh": "bhesajja、agada、bhesaja、osadha 指药物。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-1099-2-4", "zh": "331.", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "21-1100-2-5", "zh": "kusala、anāmaya、ārogya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1101-2-5", "zh": "以及 kalla、nirāmaya，都指健康无病。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-1102-2-4", "zh": "人品完。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1103-2-4", "zh": "4. 四种姓品", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "21-1104-2-2", "zh": "刹帝利品", "confidence": 85}
